WEBVTT

00:00:00.453 --> 00:00:04.444
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Hi, Sandra. Tell us a bit about your experience.

00:00:04.545 --> 00:00:05.718
Where are you working?

00:00:06.176 --> 00:00:09.449
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> I’m working in a clothes shop called FatFace.

00:00:09.856 --> 00:00:12.588
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What kind of clothes does FatFace have?

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:21.954
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Er, well, clothes for men and women, informal clothes, trousers, T-shirts, sweaters, things like that.

00:00:22.354 --> 00:00:23.746
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you do every day?

00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:30.455
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Well, er, I help the customers to find the clothes that they’re looking for.

00:00:31.004 --> 00:00:38.248
It’s a big shop and it has a lot of things. People sometimes can’t see the things that they want.

00:00:38.528 --> 00:00:39.821
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you like working there?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:46.532
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Yes, I love it. The people are really nice to me. I’m making a lot of new friends.

00:00:46.759 --> 00:00:48.461
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Is there anything you don’t like?

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:55.536
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Well, we can’t sit down, we’re standing up all the time. So that’s quite hard.

00:00:56.409 --> 00:00:58.027
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> But, in general, you’re happy?

00:00:58.162 --> 00:01:04.447
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Oh, yes. And when my two weeks finish they say I can work here on Saturdays!

00:01:04.694 --> 00:01:09.186
That’s great for me. I really like working in a clothes shop.

00:01:09.821 --> 00:01:11.314
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you wear at work?

00:01:12.069 --> 00:01:14.236
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> We wear clothes from the shop.

00:01:15.237 --> 00:01:18.062
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Are the clothes that you’re wearing today from FatFace?

00:01:18.283 --> 00:01:19.969
<v><b>Sandra:</b></v> Yes, they are!